<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11484] Get rid of ForkJoinPool#commonPool usage for system critical tasks</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11484</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We use ForkJoinPool#commonPool for sorting checkpoint pages.&lt;br/&gt;
This may backfire if common pool is already utilized in current JVM: checkpoint may wait for sorting for a long time, which in turn will cause user load dropdown.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
